Z||000012||theogre||12-29-2000||09:23 AM||||Actually it's called Flash RAM and there has been a chronic shortage of it for some time. The prices you are finding aren't as high as you think. I've seen worse.<P>It used to was SanDisk made the cards with Kodak's name one them. Shop around. You don't have to use Kodak cards any compatible card will work.<P>I've seen USB readers for both PCMCIA/Cardbus and Compact Flash. If you have one of the compact formats you should be able to find a PCMCIA adaptor for it so that you can use it in any laptop. I don't know if there are PCMCIA adaptors for the sony format.||||reg||1
